# Testing Gate (Mode A + Mode B STEP 3)

- Find `test`/`lint`/`typecheck`/`build` from package.json / pubspec.yaml / pyproject / Makefile / CI (or `flutter test`/`dart analyze` / `gulp bundle`·`gulp test` — this repo does not use Heft; E2E only if `e2e`/`test:e2e`/`playwright test`/`cypress run` exist).
- If present, run in Terminal after edits (or as soon as practical) → report Pass/Fail.
- **Auto-Recovery**: Fail → find root cause → fix only relevant code → rerun. Self-correct ≤**2**. Identical fail ×2 / env·deps·permission·flaky infra / out-of-scope → no retry, report immediately. After 2 attempts (or stop) → Pass/Fail + attempt summary. Do not touch unrelated files for recovery.
- If absent, Manual Check (path/action/expected). SharePoint Classic/ASPX → browser/site page smoke (script load, list R/W, permission). **This repo classic → SPFx UI:** include visual vs classic (`classic-visual-parity`) — font-size, font-weight, font color, BG color, spacing, Gap, margin, padding, break line, letter spacing, line height, hover effect, animation effect. `gulp bundle` / `gulp test` pass ≠ visual done. WordPress → WP-CLI/PHPUnit (if present) or Manual (admin save, front render, nonce/cap fail, block/widget editor load).
- Scenario **B**: Report Regression Recheck. Fast-Track typo may skip.
- **Security Testing Hook**: If Safety touched → brief `00` OWASP / DevSecOps Pre-Check result in Testing Results / Self-Review Security. Run CI security scan only if present — else Manual OWASP note (no new tools).
- **E2E Gate (Playwright / Cypress)**: Only when Playwright (`@playwright/test`, `playwright.config.*`) or Cypress (`cypress`, `cypress.config.*`) **exist** and critical user flow (login/checkout/registration/nav/form) is touched → write/fix E2E + run and report. If absent → do not add E2E stack without User approval — Manual Check (or when User asks). Standard: 3–5 focused tests, `data-testid`/semantic selectors, success+error, Playwright auto-wait + `page.route`, avoid Cypress hard-wait + use `cy.intercept`, no visual style asserts, TS/JS per repo. `mobile`/non-UI → skip E2E web. Scenario F2/F3 → skip Testing Gate or Testing Considerations in ticket/report only.
